Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:18.51,BD DX,On-screen text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,243.333)}DECEMBER 29, 2022 AINCRAD, FLOOR FOUR
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't get too tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:33.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't treat me like a newbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:38.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And don't you need to get \Nyour weapon serviced, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:41.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course. I took care of that yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How about you, Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:50.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Guess I should've saved my breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For sure. This sword is my baby, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, it's time. Why \Ndon't we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:13.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For those of you who don't know me, I'm \NLind from the Dragon Knights Brigade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:15.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm your raid leader for this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Glad to meet you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:22.87,BD DX,On-screen text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,270)}GUILD DRAGON KNIGHTS BRIGADE (DKB)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:27.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Kibaou of the Aincrad Liberation Squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:33.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be your sub-leader today. Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:36.88,BD DX,On-screen text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,273.333)}GUILD AINCRAD LIBERATION SQUAD (ALS)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.26,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:44.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,About the boss's attack patterns and each \Nsquad's role, it's just like I explained earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:50.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We couldn't have gotten this far \Nwithout all you top players!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:55.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And if you can lend those \Nskills of yours to this leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:57.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure that we can defeat \Nthis Floor Boss, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:03.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Leader, my eye! All you did was find \Nthe Boss Room a second before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But you know those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:07.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're feeling \Nsalty about that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh! I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen up! We're making \Nit to Floor Five today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah! You said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:27.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Almost there, guys! Just keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:28.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:31.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your gauges just dropped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:32.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Squad D, get ready to switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:34.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Squad A, get ready to charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell? We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm your leader! Stick to the rotation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:45.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sounds like an excuse to grab \Nthe last attack for yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's plain as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:48.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:49.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:14.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:16.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Argo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:18.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go, Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:38.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.72,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}Would you get off me already, Kibaou?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:11.55,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}How about getting your guys off me first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:32.95,BD DX,On-screen text,0,0,0,,SWORD ART ONLINE THE MOVIE \N-PROGRESSIVE- SCHERZO OF DEEP NIGHT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:37.00,BD DX,On-screen text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,243.333)}DECEMBER 29, 2022 AINCRAD, \NFLOOR FIVE, KARLUIN
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:46.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, to celebrate \Nreaching Floor Five...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:47.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:57.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, miss! Hit me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:07:00.94,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}We owe you big time for helping \Nus out in that Boss Raid, Argo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:03.49,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Since I didn't get a chance \Nto put the tip about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:06.53,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,the Boss Room possibly flooding \Ninto my strategy guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.82,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,that was the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was sure you'd turn me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:15.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Needless to say, you'll \Nbe getting my bill later!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:17.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, go easy on me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:23.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Still, clearing Floor Four \Ntook about a week, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Quicker than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:30.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Considering Floor One took \Na whole month to clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:33.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If we keep up this pace, we can reach \NFloor Six before the year's out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:36.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way, there's only two \Ndays left in the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call that doable... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:44.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way it wasn't simultaneous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:48.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What was?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That last attack bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:08:01.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That last move... our sword skills both \Nlanded at the same time, and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:03.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:06.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And that gives you the right \Nto the bonus because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:09.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh... well, that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:14.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I guess my skill must've landed just a split \Nsecond before yours. Sound about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:17.14,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, no... it was simultaneous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:20.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- But the system recognized my skill as \Nbeing first. - Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:21.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, Argo, tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:27.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't pull me into your couple's quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Huh? - Couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:30.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, Aachan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Pass me that roast chicken \Nover there, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:40.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But you're right, we're on a blistering pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:41.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,These raids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:45.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Floors Two, Three, and Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:47.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The pace is only ramping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:53.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's thanks to Kibaou's ALS and Lind's \NDKB blatantly trying to one-up each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:59.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Which has led to good results till now, \Nbut it's still such a flawed approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:04.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They weren't in synch during \Nyesterday's Boss Raid, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:10.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, those guys keep getting \Ninto it every time they meet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:15.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The Assault Team that we have today is an \Noffshoot of Diabel's raid party, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:19.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And since Diabel was killed \Nin the Floor One Boss Raid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:23.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lind took over and created DKB, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:27.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But then Kibaou started chafing against \NLind's leadership-oriented methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:30.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and started the more teamwork-oriented ALS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
